# Kubernetes safety

## Read-only default

List/get/log/events/top are fine when triage is authorized. Do **not**:

- delete pods/namespaces/workloads
- scale replicas
- exec into containers
- apply manifests that change cluster state

…unless the user gave an explicit verb this turn naming the object.

## Irreversible

Namespace deletes, PVC deletes, and production scale-to-zero: state the risk
and only proceed when clearly authorized (`global-execute-first` scope grill
for irreversible loss).
